                  },
                  {
                    "value": "Forecast: an ETS damped-trend model, picked over a naive forecast by a rule I wrote down before running the backtest.\n\nBacktest: 123 rolling forecasts made each month from January 2016 to March 2026, scored by the average miss in basis points and in dollars a month.\n\nUncertainty: an 80% band built from the backtest errors. Diebold-Mariano tests check whether one model's lead over another is more than luck.\n\nChallenger: a regression on the 5-year bond yield, which moves before the mortgage rate.\n\nTriage: each week the team first calls borrowers for whom it's the last chance, then fills spare calls with the most certain cases.",
